00:37:44.415 --> 00:37:48.494
At least if we're going to
ally, let's ally around making

00:37:48.515 --> 00:37:50.945
both of ourselves healthier.

00:37:51.925 --> 00:37:52.665
Andrew Huberman: Absolutely.

00:37:52.865 --> 00:37:57.844
And we're going to go deeper into how
to look into the map of self and how

00:37:58.105 --> 00:38:03.495
that relates to relationship, certainly
more as we go along this discussion.

00:38:04.774 --> 00:38:08.235
You've mentioned several times,
however, about generative drive and

00:38:08.335 --> 00:38:12.965
that it really is the definition
of like-minded in some sense.

00:38:13.745 --> 00:38:17.045
And you also mentioned aggressive
drives and pleasure drives, themes

00:38:17.045 --> 00:38:20.134
that we touched on again in episodes
